{"curationManifestSha256":"8deda35e2cb9b2aae68a6d4e2614684605ec85d50bf2ff9dddd19f7e4588283b","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1473","main":{"annotations":[],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"如果说传统文化是一株枝繁叶茂的大树，那先秦诸子就是这株大树的根。先秦诸子，百家争鸣，百花齐放，铸就了中华思想文化史上的一段辉煌。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"本单元选择了先秦诸子的一些经典论说，包括儒家的《论语》十二章、《大学》一章、《孟子》一章，道家的《老子》四章、《庄子》一章，以及墨家的《墨子·兼爱》篇。可结合以前读过的孔子、孟子、庄子等人的语录或作品，感受先秦时期百家争鸣的盛况。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"本单元集中学习先秦诸子散文，以加深对传统文化之根的理解。要注意领会先秦诸子对社会人生的洞察，思考其思想学说对立德树人、修身养性的现实意义；感受先秦诸子或雍容或犀利或雄奇或朴拙的论说风格，理解各家论说的方法，领悟其妙处。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[],"guidance":[],"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/xbs09","sourceUrl":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/xbs09","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/cover3/xbs09","title":null}],"media":[{"alt":"","bytes":119754,"finalUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/6/6723934ae750efdddb43c0e38f5a234201b7a2f2.jpeg","height":1146,"id":"media-092964b5abacbbdba034","mediaType":"image/jpeg","nativeDisposition":"verified-in-app","receiptCollectedAt":"2026-07-30T01:10:43.464Z","receiptRequired":true,"rightsBasis":"user-authorized-course-source-use-2026-07-29","sha256":"01236819712932c2ccc2ccd2ba980e54e27e8541682b1ef54d9fdfb909b6093e","sourceUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/6/6723934ae750efdddb43c0e38f5a234201b7a2f2.jpeg","webDisposition":"source-url","width":807}],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":9947,"sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"0319bd9f7623eb57ee396cafc0343cb6c4dc51dce258109a19edbdddd91be71c","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-08-09.1","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/6/6723934ae750efdddb43c0e38f5a234201b7a2f2.jpeg","postId":9947,"postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/6/6723934ae750efdddb43c0e38f5a23420